{"t":"ODFL","made":"2026-11-19 01:25","name":"Old Dominion Freight Line, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Trucking","employees":20182,"hq":"Thomasville, NC, United States","website":"https://www.odfl.com","summary_en":"Old Dominion Freight Line, Inc. operates as a less-than-truckload motor carrier in the United States and North America. The company offers regional, inter-regional, and national less-than-truckload services, as well as expedited transportation services. It also provides various value-added services, including container drayage, truckload brokerage, and supply chain consulting. In addition, the company operates fleet maintenance centers. As of December 31, 2025, it owned and operated 10,184 tractors, 30,824 linehaul trailers, and 14,313 pickup and delivery trailers. Old Dominion Freight Line, Inc. was founded in 1934 and is headquartered in Thomasville, North Carolina.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Old Dominion Freight Line, Inc.는 미국과 북미에서 소형 화물 운송업체로 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 지역, 지역 간, 전국적 화물 운송 서비스는 물론 신속한 운송 서비스도 제공합니다. 또한 컨테이너 운송, 트럭 운송 중개, 공급망 컨설팅 등 다양한 부가가치 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 회사는 차량 유지 관리 센터를 운영하고 있습니다. 2025년 12월 31일 현재 이 회사는 트랙터 10,184대, 라인홀 트레일러 30,824대, 픽업 및 배달 트레일러 14,313대를 소유 및 운영하고 있습니다. Old Dominion Freight Line, Inc.는 1934년에 설립되었으며 노스캐롤라이나주 토마스빌에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":175.7,"mcap":36201205760.0,"pe":31.543983,"fpe":25.998894,"peg":2.1262,"ps":6.255909,"pb":7.7712417,"ev_ebitda":18.58,"div":0.67,"beta":1.151,"hi52":252.03,"lo52":126.01},"fin":{"rev":5786721792.0,"rev_g":0.131,"eps_g":0.289,"gross":0.39882,"op":0.26173002,"net":0.20082001,"roe":0.26011,"fcf":997019136.0,"cash":466224000.0,"debt":19998000.0,"de":0.428,"eps":5.57,"feps":6.75798},"own":{"short":0.0553,"inst":0.80894995,"insider":0.08307},"analyst":{"n":21,"mean":213.4762,"median":215.0,"high":245.0,"low":158.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.20833,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":1,"buy":9,"hold":14,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strong